    },
    "After you first open the Cast menu, Ultimate Theater looks for Chromecast, Google TV, DLNA smart TVs, and Roku devices on your local network while a video is open. Nothing leaves your network: when you cast, the device streams the video directly from this Mac through a private, single-use link that stops working when casting ends." : {

