    },
    "Casting sends the original file to the device, which must be able to play its format; nothing is converted. Fire TV, Samsung, LG, and other smart TVs appear under DLNA when they offer it (on Fire TV, through a DLNA player app). Your Mac must stay awake and on the same network while casting." : {

