    "Erase Everything and Reset" : {

    },
    "Erases the library, every profile, watch history, settings, saved API keys, and caches, and returns the app to its first-launch state. Your movie files aren't touched." : {

    },
    "Every file plays with the built-in Theater engine. Containers: MP4, M4V, MOV, 3GP, MKV, WebM, AVI, MPEG-TS and Blu-ray/AVCHD M2TS, MPEG program streams (MPG, VOB), Ogg, FLV, and DV. Video: H.264, HEVC (including HDR10, HLG, and Dolby Vision), AV1, VP9, VP8, Theora, MPEG-1, MPEG-2, MPEG-4 Part 2 (Xvid/DivX), H.263, Apple ProRes, DV, and Motion JPEG. Audio: AAC (including LATM broadcast audio), Apple Lossless, FLAC, Opus, Vorbis, Dolby Digital, Dolby Digital Plus, Dolby TrueHD (lossless, including Atmos beds), DTS (core, including DTS-HD tracks), MP3, MP2, PCM and LPCM, ADPCM, µ-law, A-law, and AMR. Subtitles: SRT, ASS/SSA, MP4 text, Blu-ray PGS, DVD subtitles, DVB subtitles, and Teletext. Files using other formats are added and flagged." : {

